ables.account_locked == 'true'\",\n            \"is_dangerous\": false,\n            \"danger_warning\": null\n        },\n        {\n            \"step_number\": 3,\n            \"sop_step_description\": \"Generate a temporary password for the locked user and enable force change at next sign-in.\",\n            \"step_type\": \"tool_call\",\n            \"step_reasoning\": \"Gate 1-4 passed: The raw SOP describes generating a temporary password for the locked user, which matches the 'generate_temporary_password' function in the Solandra platform. The 'user_id' is derived from the prior step's output. The function ensures 'force_change_at_next_sign_in' is enabled by default.\",\n            \"platform\": \"solandra\",\n            \"function_name\": \"generate_temporary_password\",\n            \"comm_inputs\": {\n                \"user_id\": \"{{{{variables.user_id}}}}\"\n            },\n            \"command\": null,\n            \"shell\": null,\n            \"fallback_command\": null,\n            \"fallback_sop_id\": null,\n            \"expected_output_contains\": \"temporary_password\",\n            \"timeout_seconds\": 90,\n            \"output_variable\": \"password_generation_result\",\n            \"output_parse_instruction\": \"Inspect the JSON response for 'temporary_password' field. Store the value in variables.temporary_password. Confirm 'force_change_at_next_sign_in' is 'true'.\",\n            \"execute_if\": \"variables.identity_verified == 'true'\",\n            \"is_dangerous\": false,\n            \"danger_warning\": null\n        },\n        {\n            \"step_number\": 4,\n            \"sop_step_description\": \"Resolve the ticket with an audit note detailing the actions taken.\",\n            \"step_type\": \"tool_call\",\n            \"step_reasoning\": \"Gate 1-4 passed: The raw SOP describes resolving the ticket with an audit note, which matches the 'resolve_ticket' function in the Solandra platform. The 'ticket_id' is mapped to {{{{enti